  "conclusion": {
    "zh": "736车系、2,007条车系×年记录的分组交叉验证中，加入配置后R²由0.158提升至0.301（+0.143）；配置解释车系之间差异，不解释同车系短期涨跌。完整模型年度截面WMAPE为75.68%，仅作补充误差，不能与月度销量预测直接比较。",
    "en": "Across 736 series and 2,007 series-year rows, grouped CV R² rises from 0.158 to 0.301 (+0.143) after adding configuration. Configuration explains between-series differences, not short-term within-series changes. The full model's annual cross-sectional WMAPE is 75.68% and is supporting evidence, not directly comparable with monthly forecasting."
